{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！リアルミーグリありがとうございました🍡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9HP8RRWNKT3GB611MKWC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9JQCMWM989TZ8BY4JPPY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いとちゃんまめっ😕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなとの時間があまりに楽しすぎてずっと笑ってました、早くまた会いたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのお花や飾り付けなど改めて本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9KRA1EMA7QN7PHTGF23M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9MTPDPCQKS5HD8BRXYZN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9NWY3CK6QCXB35D912W4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9PZDWENF20CB4MK3PF8V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9R0PBBGQPYXQPWK9TS3Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9RZKQ6GA7DC2396QNSGV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9SZ646M8NXKB9PMZ5X92","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業のお祝いの言葉を多くの方にかけていただき嬉しかったです🎓大学で学んでいた内容をきっかけにお話して下さる方がいたのも嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都のリアルミーグリも色んなお話しましょうね🧸いつもありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9V5P759QD36BFZW4531R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は23時45分よりテレビ朝日『くりぃむナンタラ』さん\n24時29分より日本テレビ『ロロロロ』さん\n出演させていただきます🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週に引き続きどちらも2週連続で出演させていただいております！🥹先週分、まだ観れてないよという方は是非TVerでご覧くださいー☺️✨\nよろしくお願いいたします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🫧武元唯衣ダイアリー🫧\n先日、叔父と叔母が和歌山旅行に連れて行ってくれたのですが\nサプライズで卒業と誕生日のお祝いケーキを出してくれて嬉しすぎて泣きそうになりました…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃から育ててもらった私にとってはもう1人の父と母。感謝が溢れすぎて涙堪えるの必死だったー😂😭\n写真で囲んでくれているのは櫻坂を大好きでいてくれている可愛いいとこの三姉妹です☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9W7RM2D4NDSNEEYM4J0X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1E9XCET64M7R8441YRC6FX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時は少し帰省させていただけてたんですが、もう一人の大好きな叔父と2人で阪神競馬場に行ったり🐎🐎\n親戚一同で集まって恒例のMr.Childrenさん縛りのカラオケ大会をしたりして楽しみました☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて家族への感謝が溢れる帰省でした☺︎恩返しできるようにまだまだお仕事頑張ります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではっ明日夜観ててね〜〜📺"}],"source":"archive"}